load @term/seed/structure/set
  find set

# Modal logic: logic with operators for necessity and possibility, true not just here but across a space of possible
# worlds linked by an accessibility relation. Its semantics are Kripke structures, and its variants capture time,
# knowledge, provability, and obligation. The form carries the signature; the necessity and possibility operators and
# the worlds they range over are the logic.
form modal-logic
  link symbols, like set
